{"id": "c4466b08-d58f-42da-b5aa-5891491ab706", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T16:54:49.233924", "source": "agent", "parent_id": "b6a02d2f-08bb-42c1-b65e-7858ab4060a2", "thought": [], "reasoning_content": "The researcher has approved and is requesting the entire design at stage=result. Write a complete, self-contained design document in the answer. Contents to include:

